WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
♪

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.210
I’ve waited

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:05.213
Maxine: my entire life to arrive.

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:07.215
Maxine: But arriving is not the end of the journey,

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:08.925
Maxine: it’s just the beginning.

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:12.637
♪

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:13.555
Pierre: You are?

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.056
♪

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:16.391
Benjamin Franklin, ma’am.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.183
Napoleon.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.268
Maxine Simmons.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:19.310
Who?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.980
♪

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.022
John: This could change things.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.274
♪

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.818
Lucien: Creation is our way forward.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.278
♪

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.071
Melonie: There’s more to you than meets the eye.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:37.120
♪

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.080
Dusty: There are endless possibilities out there.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.165
♪

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.750
Mmm, what flavor is this?

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.459
Gin.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:43.793
That’s what I’m tasting.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.545
Edward: Do we have an alliance?

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:47.547
We have a battle.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.339
♪

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.008
Soldier: Long live the Emperor!

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.385
Maddie: I was the first to see her dead.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.929
Maddie: They say you were the last to see her alive.

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.973
Rusty: You are the best lawyer that I know,

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:57.932
and I need you.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:59.476
♪

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:02.353
John: I was born with the chance to be somebody.

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.731
♪

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.941
Daniela: Our existence is all about choices.

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:08.568
♪

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.195
Maxine: I am not in over my head.

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:12.071
It would be disrespectful to my hairdresser.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:18.620
♪

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:19.746
Yeah that’s quite impressive.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.372
♪

00:01:21.372 --> 00:01:21.998
We’re doing this!

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:35.553
♪

